      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tailored thermo-mechanical processing can produce an ultrafine-grained duplex microstructure while retaining the composite lamellar character.",
